@bpintea I try your sql above in CsvTests, like below:
```

unfoldedCountingFails
FROM employees | STATS c1 = count(emp_no) WHERE emp_no < 10042;

c1:long
41
;
```
I tested it three times with c1 using three different values: [40, 41, 42]. The values 40 and 42 resulted in errors, while 41 was correct. Therefore, I believe this issue has been resolved.
